From b971753fa66925dd3ad49908de154b23493455c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:51:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): scale output budget with the input program

Allow large programs while retaining finite emission and buffer guards.
Report the exhausted limit, attempted count, and current operation.
Pin Tormach whole and per-operation output and runaway refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3002
